    <string name="battery_title">Keep playing in the background</string>
    <string name="battery_text">Android and some manufacturers stop background apps to save battery. The sound may then stop suddenly at night. Please allow Tinnisoft to be excluded from optimization. Tinnisoft itself uses little power.</string>
    <string name="battery_request">Request exemption</string>
    <string name="battery_ok">Battery optimization is off for Tinnisoft. Great!</string>
    <string name="battery_not_ok">Battery optimization is still on. The sound may be stopped in the background.</string>
    <string name="tips_samsung_title">Samsung</string>
    <string name="tips_samsung">Settings › Battery › Background usage limits: add Tinnisoft to ‘Never sleeping apps’. Optionally turn off ‘Put unused apps to sleep’.</string>
    <string name="tips_xiaomi_title">Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO</string>
    <string name="tips_xiaomi">Settings › Apps › Tinnisoft: turn on ‘Autostart’ and set ‘Battery saver’ to ‘No restrictions’. Optionally lock the app in the recent apps overview (padlock).</string>
    <string name="tips_other_title">Other devices</string>
    <string name="tips_other">Look for ‘Battery’ in the settings and remove restrictions for Tinnisoft. dontkillmyapp.com has tips per brand.</string>
